    affiliation: "NullLab"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/NullLabTests/manim-evolution-story"
abstract: >
  An educational animated video series rendered with Manim Community Edition,
  covering 13.8 billion years of evolutionary history across 13 animated chapters.
  Demonstrates a complete production pipeline from Python animation scripts to
  polished video output, including 4K upscaling and procedurally generated audio.
keywords:
